   <a class="skip-link" href="#maincontent">Skip to main content</a>
   <main id="maincontent" tabindex="-1">
     <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="quiz-title">
       <span class="eyebrow">Interactive quiz</span>
       <h1 id="quiz-title">Computer languages quiz</h1>
       <p>Pick every answer you think applies. Each question allows multiple selections, and your score is based on fully correct answer sets.</p>
